{
  "description": "APPLICATION FOR VARIATION OF CONDITION 9 (OPENING HOURS), ATTACHED TO LBM PLANNING APPLICATION&nbsp;04/P0804&nbsp;RELATING TO THEERECTION OF A PART 4 AND PART 5 STOREY BUILDING COMPRISING 12 X 2 BED SELF CONTAINED FLATS AND 6 COMMERCIAL UNITS INCLUDING A RETAIL (CLASS A1) UNIT (710 SQ.METRES), 3 RESTAURANT (CLASS A3) UNITS (GROSS FLOORSPACE 1016 SQ.METRES) AND THE REMAINING 2 UNITS (236 SQ.METRES) TO BE USED FOR EITHER A1 OR A2 OR A3 OR B1; RATIONALISATION OF THE TANDEM CENTRE OVER-SPILL CAR PARK TO THE NORTH OF THE SITE.&nbsp;THE APPLICATION SEEKS PERMISSION TO ENABLE THE 24-HOUR\r\nOPERATION OF THE RESTAURANT, SEVEN DAYS A WEEK.",
